<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"/><view class="detail-top"><button class="back" bindtap="back">‹</button><view class="detail-title">发起人主页</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在打开主页…</view><block wx:else wx:if="{{profile}}"><view class="public-profile"><view class="avatar"><image wx:if="{{profile.avatar_file_id}}" src="{{profile.avatar_file_id}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text wx:else>{{initial}}</text></view><view class="profile-name">{{profile.nickname}}</view><view class="profile-meta">{{profile.city}} · {{profile.pace}}</view><view class="profile-bio">{{profile.bio}}</view><view class="divider"/><view class="section-kicker">与这次出发有关</view><view class="facts">常见时间：{{profile.availability}}<br/>这是一份公开的、有限的资料；私密记录和未选择分享的信息不会展示。</view><view wx:if="{{profile.photo_file_ids.length}}" class="photo-grid public-photos"><block wx:for="{{profile.photo_file_ids}}" wx:key="*this"><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill"/></block></view></view></block><view wx:else class="empty">暂时无法打开这位发起人的主页。</view></view>